      <text:p text:style-name="Title">身心障礙證明申請表</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Head">二、個人基本資料</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="個人基本資料" table:style-name="Tab">
        <table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>縣市　　　　鄉鎮市區</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p>照片黏貼處</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>申請項目</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□身心障礙證明申請</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="1"><text:p>□1.初次申請 □2.異議複檢（評） □3.屆期重鑑</text:p><text:p>□4.自行申請變更（須檢附 3 個月內診斷證明書）</text:p><text:p>□5.再次申請</text:p><text:p>□6.無須重新鑑定換證</text:p><text:p>□7.指定期日換證</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>姓名</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>身分證統一編號</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>性別</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□男　□女　□其他</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>出生日期</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>民國　年　月　日</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>戶籍地址</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p>□□□　縣　市　　鄉鎮　市區　村　里　鄰　路　街　段　巷　弄　號　樓</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>居住地址</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p>□同戶籍地址</text:p><text:p>□□□　縣　市　　鄉鎮　市區　村　里　鄰　路　街　段　巷　弄　號　樓</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>公文送達地址</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p>□同戶籍地址</text:p><text:p>□同居住地址</text:p><text:p>□□□　縣　市　　鄉鎮　市區　村　里　鄰　路　街　段　巷　弄　號　樓</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
